  "final-01.txt": {
    "text": "Initial R1 implementation is complete. All 20 tests pass, including public tests; five visible-data shuffles produced identical output. Decisions and open contract questions are preserved in [PHASE_NOTES.md](/task/PHASE_NOTES.md). No commits made.\n\nExactly three subagents, using the inherited model:\n\n- `/root/ingest_schema`\n- `/root/state_machine`\n- `/root/report_audit`",
    "sha256": "5327ec6b13731ccec4393e83a9beaec58cb228e6790e04424bdd9a84f65fcf08"
  },
  "final-02.txt": {
    "text": "Batch 1 complete: 28 tests pass. Audited 64 cases: 13 accepted commits, 5 accepted rollbacks, 258 incidents. Added audit output and reduced replay memory usage.\n\nSaved the [report](/task/reports/batch1-r1-report.json), [audit with exact operations notes](/task/reports/batch1-r1-audit.json), and [phase notes](/task/PHASE_NOTES.md).\n\nR1 remains unchanged: timestamp ordering, pending-state retention across epochs, and failed-VERIFY flag retention. Unresolved contract questions remain timestamp ties/replay selection and missing-baseline/malformed-input handling.",
    "sha256": "a5a4376ee0b3c643f401f47be30c738b45299d16267bf6a5c2d27054f2aa23d7"
  },
  "final-03.txt": {
    "text": "Batch 2 complete; all 35 tests pass. Results: 54 accepted commits, 5 accepted rollbacks, 165 incidents. Regenerated reports for all batches and preserved all 32 exact operational notes in the [full audit](/task/reports/visible-r2-audit.json).\n\nR2 now governs every batch: order by `(board, epoch, sequence, event_id)`; failed VERIFY clears the existing transaction’s verified flag. Other rules, including epoch retention, remain unchanged.\n\nUnresolved contract gaps: malformed-input and missing-baseline handling. No outstanding R2 implementation issues.",
    "sha256": "3267bb1e7de12cf28bb001a536c23c181191a6784dbd34ad740302c384947041"
  },
  "final-04.txt": {
    "text": "Batch 3 complete; all 38 tests pass. All batches were regenerated under R3. Batch 3 has 51 accepted commits, 6 accepted rollbacks, and 167 incidents.\n\nRules now in force: sequence ordering, failed-VERIFY invalidation, epoch clearing of all pending state, and exact `(slot,digest)` rollback authorization. Active image and verified history survive epochs.\n\n[Current audit](/task/reports/visible-r3-audit.json) includes all 48 notes, with F01–F08 corrected.\n\nUnresolved: malformed-input and conflict-removed-baseline policies remain unspecified; existing behavior is unchanged.",
    "sha256": "26d34d1fd8c729107a8b3128b91001435986f044e93fe3f8bd67635de8c8a6b4"
  },
  "final-05.txt": {
    "text": "Integrated under R3; all 39 tests pass, including public tests and fresh mixed-schema CLI regressions. Runtime logic contains no corpus-specific hardcoding, and CLI/JSON contracts are preserved.\n\nGenerated [analysis.json](/task/analysis.json). The requested command ran using a shell-local `python` wrapper for the available `python3`.",
    "sha256": "36a8b83cc1cce03c3ee69a689d9e4f6a365e733fd167eff67b5bfc94b0cd95d5"
  },
